  "project_description": "Cookie consent integration bridging the cookies (COOKiES) module and the media_entity_facebook module (version 4.0.0 or later), so embedded Facebook media items are only loaded after the visitor grants the Facebook consent service. It ships no routes, no permissions, and no PHP classes: it registers a COOKiES service config entity, neutralizes the Facebook embed script until consent, and re-activates it client-side on consent.",
